00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:31.450
What would be the alternative to that?

00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:32.500
When you say not always,

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:34.540
give me another scenario that's not that.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:36.460
- Sometimes I actually eliminate
myself from the equation

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.270
and allow my managers and my
recruiters to make the call.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.343
