00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.430
Every mistake James and
Nick Dio make is my fault.

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:50.338
So if you're taking
yourself out of the equation

00:05:50.338 --> 00:05:52.740
then you're empowering people

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.480
who are saying no instead of
yes, which is still on you

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.373
is how I see it.

00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.160
If you're telling me the question

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:01.570
that you are most worried about

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:02.553
which makes a ton of sense to me

00:06:02.553 --> 00:06:03.940
because you're on it

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.659
because it is the number one
issue for service businesses

00:06:06.659 --> 00:06:08.713
is not hiring,

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.250
that's you.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.104
That's either you, whether
you're in the equation or not

00:06:14.104 --> 00:06:16.740
it's still you because
you're the one that hired

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:17.630
the people that are making that choice.

00:06:17.630 --> 00:06:19.253
- How would you then,

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.920
what would be maybe
the strategy to attract

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.947
maybe that ideal person of
what you're looking for?

00:06:26.947 --> 00:06:29.920
I mean I can't just hire
everybody and anybody.

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:32.930
- Of course not but by
then first understanding

00:06:32.930 --> 00:06:37.340
what ideological framework
that decision is being made on.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:39.200
Once you let go of the fact that

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:40.590
you're making a subjective call

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:43.910
and so are your managers
and that they're not right,

00:06:43.910 --> 00:06:46.520
they're making a subjective call

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.920
then it becomes easier
to say yes more than no.

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:52.010
I think of it as like
tie goes to the runner.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:55.286
Once you change this
perspective on this conversation

00:06:55.286 --> 00:06:58.270
you'll start saying yes a lot of times

00:06:58.270 --> 00:06:59.760
